    "abstract": "As AI agents ask increasingly complex and frequent questions, analytics systems must become more responsive, scalable, and efficient, over hundreds of Terabytes and trillions of rows. This session explores how GPU acceleration integrated with Amazon EMR can improve performance and efficiency, with the NVIDIA cuDF Router that enables seamless migration and simplifies adoption across a large enterprise setting. Applying operational metrics to AI-driven optimization, the smart router continuously directs workloads for better performance and cost efficiency. See how enterprises can operate this architecture over hundreds of jobs in a fraction of time and hear the practical lessons learned along the way.",
